\subsection{Tuning}{

In the earlier work the MP was tuned by the position of the upper buffer.
Here \code{tunepar} sets the upper buffer to
\code{LowerBuffer + (UpperBuffer - LowerBuffer) / tunepar}, so that larger values
of \code{tunepar} move the upper buffer towards the lower buffer and increase the
catch. \code{tunepar = 1} uses \code{UpperBuffer}.
